FORMAT: 1A
HOST: https://polls.apiblueprint.org/

# Polls

Polls is a simple API allowing consumers to view polls and vote in existing ones.

# Group Question

Resources related to polls in the API.

## Questions Collection [/questions]

### List All Questions [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Attributes (array[Question])

## Question [/questions/{question_id}]

+ Parameters
    + question_id (number) - ID of the Question in the form of an integer

### View a Question Detail [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Attributes (Question)

### Vote on a Question [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        + choice_id: 1 (number, required) - Choice ID to vote for

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Headers

            X-My-Header: yes

    + Attributes (Question)

# Data Structures

## Question (object)
+ id: 1 (number)
+ question: What is your favorite programming language? (string)
+ choices (array[Choice])

## Choice (object)
+ id: 1 (number)
+ choice: Ruby (string)
